{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1000_045kar", "source_sha256": "bce063925f564df817e9e6a372f5e0ca4d97eb9554f636763f01204e01f6790f", "ja": "真美、ちゃん？　あ、あの、でも……。", "zh": "真美？啊，那个，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "36e0bb5f7a44bed4eb35d5734536df18829774bd51ed1d956f627ae55c2fa3e2", "ja": "どったの、しのみやん？\n真美のせくしーに惚れちゃったかな～♪", "zh": "怎么啦，诗织酱？\n是不是被真美的性感迷住啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "9edde8e0065782d80bc356d906b8988c2317cb05cabb4bb67982cbd50e367a1f", "ja": "あ……そ、そうだね！\n本当に、真美ちゃんそっくり……あっ。", "zh": "啊……对、对啊！\n真的，和真美一模一样……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "e9b09e601371e9ebcf02da3abb8e350ca40f60f82172c81bf8d745dc480187f8", "ja": "？　そっくりってことは、やっぱり、\n真美センセーじゃなくて亜美シショーなのかい？", "zh": "？既然说长得很像，那果然不是真美老师，而是亚美师父吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "abef860a8c416ef30e2c3084f352ac6942331892fd715284b96a077b1a2cb36d", "ja": "うあうあ！　せっかくややこしいドッキリ思いついた\nのに、秒でバレるってどういうこと～！？", "zh": "哇啊哇啊！好不容易才想到一个这么让人摸不着头脑的恶作剧，\n怎么一秒就被识破了啦～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "0776f07f9ed5505301ff5ae04c29d2b5833daaf7d540fc90d1b7c767273efad2", "ja": "ご、ごめんねっ。ずっと亜美ちゃんの匂いしか\nしなかったから、つい……。", "zh": "对、对不起嘛。因为一直只能闻到亚美的味道，所以一不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "082cc1a1eafa056d16a82c74b80a7355fd9da788c34949d2f7ec61d357efbeca", "ja": "もう、匂いでわかっちゃうのハンソクだよ～。\nちゃんとお風呂も入ってるのに～！", "zh": "真是的，靠气味认出来太犯规了啦～。\n我明明都有好好洗澡的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1007_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1008_p", "source_sha256": "baa7b780bbd1ae3382c205a1fb7e858a1cbfff45306a6a2a9a66ae4a0e701a4f", "ja": "おっ、三人ともそろってるな。\nみんな、お疲れさま。", "zh": "哦，三个人都到齐了啊。\n大家辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "fbe1bfc6c529dfb388cd58ad833360d7e29611cebf4431a414f6662d65c3ad01", "ja": "あみ！　ひなた！　可憐お姉ちゃ～ん！\nただいまだぞ～！", "zh": "亚美！日向！可怜大姐姐～！\n我回来啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "fb88d1e29578302e25f9b41c4497363badc11f5dace41819182cd306762e900a", "ja": "お、お帰りなさい……♪", "zh": "欢、欢迎回来……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "f25a80955f5a0bc94248d6cafe52785288418c0743fc8a8f879b859fb43259b2", "ja": "たまきちとゆきぴょんは、ショッピングモールの\nロケだったよね？　どうだったー？", "zh": "环环和雪步步是在购物中心取景的，对吧？感觉怎么样——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "293324ff813817d63771259e153045b50e3019283c1b2b47e3f235edaa467de2", "ja": "話題のスポットで、男の人もたくさんいたけど\n元気な環ちゃんと一緒なおかげで、平気だったよ！", "zh": "在热门景点虽然有很多男人，但幸好有精神满满的环在身边，所以没关系！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "6a4faf386b6458c8735f1b384d7cc05b4b13d98b5d7a484b42cf7ee1e439af99", "ja": "そりゃあよかったわー。{$P$}、\nあたし達は、遊園地の紹介だったよねぇ？", "zh": "那真是太好了呀——。{$P$}，\n我们是负责介绍游乐园，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1014_p", "source_sha256": "38033424c6cef14fdef1a22591416c38f918995c582563707ed3f8cff8707c7b", "ja": "ああ、入れ替わりで出発だ。\nバタバタで申し訳ないけど、しっかり頼むぞ。", "zh": "啊，要轮流出发了。\n虽然现在有点手忙脚乱的，拜托你们好好加油了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "b658363948394db6dc06883aa5ff7ca575327133c6d974054775e1a0fadd3440", "ja": "大丈夫！　絶叫マシーンなんて、\n亜美たちにかかればお茶づけホイホイっしょ！", "zh": "没问题！绝叫设施什么的，对亚美我们来说还不是小菜一碟嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1016_p", "source_sha256": "1af3560795507b809025d0855d2c57d1d5a0b58eea937cb70a073b2adb087291", "ja": "うん、お茶の子サイサイだけど似たようなもんだ。\nその勢いで頼むぞ！", "zh": "嗯，虽然是“小菜一碟”，不过也差不多啦。\n就保持这股气势拜托你啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "ea47cde5463086f69eccce4bf67c0f5de7786c531a394864fd7e30f4284d4d66", "ja": "あみ、遊園地行くの？　たまきも行きたい！\nねえねえ、おーやーぶーん！！", "zh": "亚美，你要去游乐园吗？环也想去！\n呐呐，老——大——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1018_p", "source_sha256": "47f0434984cc5b68289fb42cf5717310c493dfcf2a5b37e8710be0f4459db68b", "ja": "ダメダメ、遊びじゃなくて仕事なんだから。\n環はしっかり留守番してくれないと。", "zh": "不行不行，这不是去玩，而是去工作的。环，你得好好留下来看家才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "b89d65c533140a59e614d0f1e16a7c99aa4f9e7e2d8104c8dd58de3ade7d7095", "ja": "劇場は任せたぜ、たまきち。最新型ドリル旋回\nコースターのレポートは、亜美たちに任せるのだ～！", "zh": "剧场就交给你了，环环。最新型钻头旋转过山车的报告，就交给亚美她们啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "10505f4a314aa0d0685ec3a2126b3d244baf6cf6253e35b0e32151b0a5c63ad6", "ja": "あう……。", "zh": "啊呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "31dd2baed3098a82a3352a97b3e8da0f7c109a53da6666a2ddb1776576387d0b", "ja": "？　可憐ちゃん？", "zh": "？可怜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "7eee8e80809851ddd601142ba97f2576d427615fa95d89b8cd29247dc40d3b66", "ja": "あっ、ううん、なんでも……。\nぜ、絶叫マシーンのレポート、私もがんばるねっ。", "zh": "啊，不，没什么……。\n尖叫机的报道，我、我也会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1023_004yuk", "source_sha256": "885203a1727cbb28ee3b1bddd028ab56729e0fcc49cc88c979b95f598e48ceec", "ja": "可憐ちゃん……。あ、あのね？\n本当にダメな時は、ダメって言って大丈夫だからね？", "zh": "可怜……那、那个？\n要是真的不行，说出来也没关系的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1024_004yuk", "source_sha256": "dfba79efe1089fe300061e087e284b8414eb1b653f82bcfbf80eb36a7845834d", "ja": "あああっ、余計なお世話だったらごめんね！？\nでも無理してるように見えたから、その……。", "zh": "啊啊啊，要是我多管闲事了，对不起！？  \n可是看起来你好像在勉强自己，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1025_045kar", "source_sha256": "15f9e5ad3ef2b1193dc0c28e35900f9e4ab4425d952b799ef94e70e801602f4d", "ja": "雪歩ちゃん……。あ、ありがとうございます。\nで、でも、私も挑戦したいから……。", "zh": "雪步……啊，谢谢你。可、可是，我也想挑战一下，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1026_011ami", "source_sha256": "af248d2fee4c7e26603a1706726e1e9ce0677d1470bcfedeba5b97c9faed6b95", "ja": "なんか番組ディレクターの兄ちゃんが\nしのみやんご指名なんだよね？", "zh": "好像节目导演哥哥点名要可怜来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1027_p", "source_sha256": "b3c482c1dd25a8787346c1a0c1eeb082f3474e2b1f4b1fc7236b122b88977f16", "ja": "ああ、苦手な子の方がリアクションがいいからって。\nでも可憐、本当に大丈夫か？", "zh": "啊，因为听说不擅长应付这类事的孩子，反应会更好。\n不过可怜，你真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1028_045kar", "source_sha256": "058f404a06479f3b93b30198799260812a0f7c572efe191a7e8443f0f39415a5", "ja": "は、はいっ！　へ、平気……じゃ、ないかもですけど、\nせっかく、期待してもらえたから……。", "zh": "是、是的！没、没事……可能，也不是没事，\n难得得到期待……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1029_045kar", "source_sha256": "214ab6b4fb8ab51de3ef0ab5c5ac456c4814b97e1dc452bd702e03c6cbe354d2", "ja": "わ、私も、アイドルとして、期待に応えたくて……。\n挑戦、したいんです……！", "zh": "我、我也想作为一名偶像，回应大家的期待……\n想要，去挑战看看……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1030_035hin", "source_sha256": "5219990c2258d8b5a81a3d9e6cf5380007f46e763281c7057617badb4cc7c2ea", "ja": "可憐さん。じつはあたしも、ちょっこし怖くってねぇ。\n怖がってる者同士、一緒にがんばろうねぇ。", "zh": "可怜小姐。其实我也稍微有点害怕呢。\n同为胆小鬼，我们一起加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1031_045kar", "source_sha256": "54f855d3c1ab218ea35635d5adf0f5eb00042645f4a29fdaf191eaf9ee8390b9", "ja": "ひなたちゃん……。\nうん……がんばろうね……っ♪", "zh": "日向……。\n嗯……一起加油吧……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1032_p", "source_sha256": "375ffdcee61b40238acc205ea4cd6ab1a7d3b1aabb3a8b2c53d96eeaa27ce6d2", "ja": "……わかった。\nそれじゃ、出発しよう！", "zh": "……我知道了。\n那我们出发吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1033_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1034_jettokosutakyaku", "source_sha256": "17b143920117d3a28f08e216a655595edd506e1220d29006cae82a1791168aa7", "ja": "キャーーーーーーーーーーーーーー！！！！！！！！！", "zh": "啊——————！！！！！！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1035_045kar", "source_sha256": "b9674d747bb92bb066fc74c61af995ff9fd4b0496fc8e90ff78423ece73b6fc5", "ja": "ひいいいいぃぃぃぃ……っ！！", "zh": "呜啊啊啊啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1036_011ami", "source_sha256": "40f0ad6b19800f5567bd3b70f7824a4f301d6dbb904e98b6a9bcbd7092fb58f7", "ja": "おお～。コースターは全然遠くなのに、\nここまで絶叫が聞こえてくるとは……本物ですなぁ。", "zh": "哦哦～明明过山车离得还很远，却能听到这么响的尖叫声……真是名副其实啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_153_1037_035hin", "source_sha256": "26d938f4a2113b8ba7952745487abd6c650a11443e3fc97a84e31893a01c610f", "ja": "はや～、たまげたねぇ。レールが高すぎて、\n上の方がかすんで見えるべさ。", "zh": "哎呀～真让人吃惊啊。轨道太高了，连上面都看得模模糊糊的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
